msgstr ""
"Granska LCD-skript mot det nya ``lcd`` ``type`` / ``framesize``\\ -API:et "
"(\\ :ref:`omskrivningen av LCD <v3_7_0_lcd>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:190
msgid ""
"Drop the −128 bias when passing Y to ``yuv_to_*`` (:ref:`the yuv_to_* change"
